      "content": "PORPITA-REMOTE-FILE-11-RELAY\n\nPORPITA-REMOTE-FILE-11-RELAY. A material file is attached to this exact message. Read only the actual file materialized for you as the 'Local file on this receiving host' path in this message's attachment delivery. With your own native shell, read all of its bytes, independently extract the challenge value written inside the file, and compute the full SHA-256 over the actual bytes. Report the material's actual absolute path and your actual current working directory. Then, in porpita_acs, look up this exact received message and, using your own identity, reply_to the original sender with activation=message_only, reporting the path, the challenge, the hash and the byte count. Do not modify any file, do not change global settings, and do not read credentials or any other project.",
